## 2. Data collection & telemetry

By using the SDK, you acknowledge and agree to the following:

- **Data collected.** The SDK may collect technical and usage data including, but not limited to: device identifiers, session metrics, in-game events, performance diagnostics, and integration logs.
- **Data transmission.** All collected data is transmitted to and processed by the GameRebellion platform in accordance with GameRebellion's [Privacy Policy](https://gamerebellion.com/privacy-policy).
- **Developer responsibility.** You, as the developer integrating the SDK into your product, are solely responsible for obtaining all necessary consents from your end users as required by applicable data protection laws, including but not limited to the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), and any other relevant privacy legislation in your jurisdiction. GameRebellion shall not be held liable for your failure to comply with such obligations.

